{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_042miy_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_042miy_3000_situation", "source_sha256": "ac7e4d413418fb8817f907a97d65f00072cd2e812c693fd3e53106bb73ef6dba", "ja": "グラビア撮影のお仕事", "zh": "写真摄影的工作", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_042miy_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_042miy_3000_place", "source_sha256": "ddc30c921623e6f9ad62f029bab2c52933a649f79a46010d9b150b4c8c70b8cb", "ja": "ロケ地", "zh": "外景地", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_042miy_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_042miy_3001_p", "source_sha256": "7375b6e9a6e2f82bdfebc9459a45385e7a35201276c5b286ac22f02292ffafa7", "ja": "今日はグラビアの撮影だな。\n美也、とびきりの笑顔を頼むぞ！", "zh": "今天的工作是拍摄写真呢，\n美也，就拜托你展现灿烂的笑容啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_042miy_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_042miy_3002_042miy", "source_sha256": "e34eb3a3f3555d0d3451ec3aa21acf8346f181e70831146baac119e3875717c3", "ja": "むふふ、わかってますよ～。笑顔ですね～。\nポーズはどうしましょう～？", "zh": "呵呵，我知道喔～笑容对吧～\n那姿势要怎么办呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_042miy_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_042miy_3003_p", "source_sha256": "2cb6bf2593c0e9fd6fdedfd24912177ff7d52353b8d071e50d5a15a8ae97590a", "ja": "え、ポーズ？", "zh": "咦，姿势？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_042miy_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_042miy_3004_042miy", "source_sha256": "09e0ac7d5a6d1eebc4927d836d38a46ad2885ef74a9a046f949af58947903573", "ja": "はい～、ポーズですよ～。\nグラビア撮影ですからね～。", "zh": "对～就是姿势喔～\n因为是写真摄影呀～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_042miy_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_042miy_3005", "source_sha256": "a72775c43e574800e7710bf80a18e5d09048b588a7c1d34c62fa8ff3fb7bb26e", "ja": "セクシー", "zh": "性感", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_042miy_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_042miy_3006", "source_sha256": "364b39c23d4b9fce3579fe268c5888c41d3b9a472ef5fe2f82e2faeb88876960", "ja": "キュート", "zh": "可爱", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_042miy_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_042miy_3100_p", "source_sha256": "2dfa696d20e9db0fc0fff0e7fc265de34ba9d73e130cc6da92ad898eaedd2013", "ja": "そうだな……\nここは、セクシーな感じで頼む。", "zh": "这个嘛……\n今天就拜托你走性感路线了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_042miy_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_042miy_3101_042miy", "source_sha256": "4bb1301087b876ab50fe1cc77320cf996a981d1896f5bb765e426d22b33716f5", "ja": "セクシーなポーズですか～。\nたとえば、どんな感じでしょう～？", "zh": "性感姿势吗～\n举例来说，是什么感觉呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_042miy_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_042miy_3102_p", "source_sha256": "23f543f0bc9c854539ec1524b8651039dc40040bde32016ed9c4dd7353d11995", "ja": "たとえばか……\nこう、前かがみになって獣のようにだな……。", "zh": "举例吗……\n像这样，上半身向前倾，像野兽一样吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_042miy_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_042miy_3103_042miy", "source_sha256": "5aaa6f69d2f455e3b44995da64e2d6f38017e84b086949c29ae56b1190806404", "ja": "お～。なるほど、獣のようにですね、わかりました～。\nがおがお～、ふふふ♪", "zh": "喔～原来如此，像野兽一样啊，我懂了～\n吼吼吼～呵呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_042miy_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_042miy_3104_p", "source_sha256": "45ab1a8f776a2b4f65fd091d92f541f3585887330cee7a986afef85bc84b7e68", "ja": "（ちょっと違うんだが……\nまぁ、ポーズは決まっているから大丈夫か）", "zh": "（虽然好像不太一样……\n不过姿势摆得很到位，就没问题了吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_042miy_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_042miy_3200_p", "source_sha256": "2dfa696d20e9db0fc0fff0e7fc265de34ba9d73e130cc6da92ad898eaedd2013", "ja": "そうだな……\nここは、セクシーな感じで頼む。", "zh": "这个嘛……\n今天就拜托你走性感路线了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_042miy_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_042miy_3201_042miy", "source_sha256": "58afc77f515fc064399a191349f6e37fd02504eec0cf769060fb6fca0ad21a4c", "ja": "セクシーな感じ……思いつきませんね～。\n困りました～……む～ん。", "zh": "性感路线……我想不到耶～\n好烦恼喔……唔～嗯。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_042miy_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_042miy_3202_042miy", "source_sha256": "5d034aab4f498bb87509ebe113a74657ecaebb5b8426caea809238316545755b", "ja": "{$P$}さん、\n一緒に考えてもらえませんか～？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，\n你可以跟我一起想吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_042miy_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_042miy_3300_p", "source_sha256": "5a33b84b5c23cfb505b11706c8c9e718c4d0f5329dfd05dd5eddc71b9386a58d", "ja": "やっぱりアイドルだからな、\nキュートな感じでいこう！", "zh": "毕竟还是偶像，\n就走可爱路线吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_042miy_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_042miy_3301_042miy", "source_sha256": "b62cf41c157709198e7ca3b793f444f1604f9b93198b8d89b0cf6044c2b9ede3", "ja": "キュートですね、わかりましたよ～。\nかわいいポーズがいいんですね～。ふふふ。", "zh": "可爱是吗，我明白了喔～\n所以要摆可爱的姿势对吧～呵呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_042miy_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_042miy_3302_042miy", "source_sha256": "91f273645a66091cca475632533d0f022178561a44064987da93dc9e6b759e51", "ja": "かわいいポーズ……やっぱり、猫の手でしょうか～。\nみゃおみゃお～。", "zh": "说到可爱的姿势……应该就是猫咪手势吧～\n喵喔喵喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_042miy_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_042miy_3303_p", "source_sha256": "9f56bda213ef12c3879c84b8d62761b7fb63c6fcf4417d0ccfe3a6b428abb3b4", "ja": "猫のポーズも可愛いけど、\nそれなら普段の美也の方がいいかな。自然に頼む！", "zh": "虽然猫咪的姿势也很可爱，\n但这样看来还是平常的美也比较好吧，自然的就好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_042miy_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_042miy_3304_042miy", "source_sha256": "6ad6c9a05a96394799845efdd2232f824d6e958f7d68d2786bd232f8170617b7", "ja": "普段の私、ですか～。\nふふふ、なんだか照れちゃいますね～。", "zh": "平常的我吗～\n呵呵呵，总觉得有点不好意思呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_042miy_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_042miy_3400_p", "source_sha256": "5a33b84b5c23cfb505b11706c8c9e718c4d0f5329dfd05dd5eddc71b9386a58d", "ja": "やっぱりアイドルだからな、\nキュートな感じでいこう！", "zh": "毕竟还是偶像，\n就走可爱路线吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_042miy_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_042miy_3401_042miy", "source_sha256": "ab1e8ad049cebe0f5ed1c7ab6584fd0bb4bd12691b57c69f4474d8fc1199777f", "ja": "キューッと……なるほど、キューッとコンパクトに、\nですね～。わかりましたよ～。では、行ってきます～。", "zh": "可矮……原来如此，要可以矮矮缩成一小团吧～\n我明白了喔～那我去拍了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_042miy_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_042miy_3402_p", "source_sha256": "823645089c9bf1b2a8bb7f3954bbdd31a1dbb72b94b184e83eeeb7e74174fb70", "ja": "（キューッとコンパクト……？\n美也、大丈夫だろうか……）", "zh": "（可以矮矮缩成一小团……？\n美也真的没问题吗……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
